#: web/templates/web/metric_change.html:9
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This experiment has been optimizing <strong>%(original)s</strong>.\n"
"        Running now for <strong>%(chosen)s</strong> changes the optimized "
"metric —\n"
"        the trials accumulated so far were optimized for %(original)s.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dieses Experiment hat bisher <strong>%(original)s</strong> optimiert. Ein "
"Lauf mit <strong>%(chosen)s</strong> ändert die optimierte Metrik — die "
"bisher gesammelten Versuche wurden für %(original)s optimiert."

#: web/templates/web/metric_change.html:20
#, python-format
